---
// Direct visual showdown of respecting intended asset size:
// Row 1: 24px icon scaled up 3x (chunky strokes) vs 24px icon inside a 64px tinted shape.
// Row 2: full 1440px UI screenshot shrunk to fit a small card (unreadable micro-text) vs simplified/cropped UI.
const uid = Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 8);
const W = 900;
const H = 430;
---
<figure class="img-sz">
  <div class="img-sz-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Comparison showing why scaling small icons up makes strokes look chunky and shrinking full screenshots makes text unreadable, versus framing icons inside a shape and cropping or simplifying UI previews.">
      {/* Row 1: Icons */}
      <text x="20" y="26" class="img-sz-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>1. Small icons (drawn for 16–24 px)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>1. Icon nhỏ (vẽ cho cỡ 16–24 px)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Left card: Scaled up 3x (Wrong) */}
      <rect x="20" y="42" width="415" height="150" rx="8" class="img-sz-card is-bad" />
      <text x="38" y="68" class="img-sz-label is-bad">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Stretched to 72 px (chunky strokes)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Phóng lên 72 px (nét bị thô và dày)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Stretched bell/shield icon: 24px icon scaled 3x -> 4.5px stroke! */}
      <g transform="translate(56, 86)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="76" height="76" rx="8" class="img-sz-stage" />
        <g transform="translate(14, 14) scale(2)" fill="none" stroke="var(--text)" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 2L4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9.7 8 11 4.6-1.3 8-6 8-11V5l-8-3z" />
          <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" />
        </g>
      </g>
      <text x="150" y="114" class="img-sz-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>A 1.5 px stroke becomes 4.5 px wide.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nét 1,5 px bị phóng thành 4,5 px.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="150" y="136" class="img-sz-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Corners feel bloated and detail is missing.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Góc bo trở nên nặng nề, thiếu chi tiết.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="150" y="162" class="img-sz-meta">
        <tspan data-lang-en>24 px vector × 300%</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vector 24 px × 300%</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right card: Framed in a shape (Correct) */}
      <rect x="465" y="42" width="415" height="150" rx="8" class="img-sz-card" />
      <text x="483" y="68" class="img-sz-label">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Kept at 24 px inside a 64 px shape</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Giữ nguyên 24 px trong khung 64 px</tspan>
      </text>

      <g transform="translate(501, 86)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="76" height="76" rx="8" class="img-sz-stage" />
        <circle cx="38" cy="38" r="28" class="img-sz-tint" />
        <g transform="translate(26, 26)" fill="none" stroke="var(--red)" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 2L4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9.7 8 11 4.6-1.3 8-6 8-11V5l-8-3z" />
          <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" />
        </g>
      </g>
      <text x="595" y="114" class="img-sz-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>The container carries the visual weight.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Khung nền gánh phần trọng lượng thị giác.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="595" y="136" class="img-sz-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>The icon stays crisp at its drawn stroke.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Icon giữ đúng độ mảnh như lúc thiết kế.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="595" y="162" class="img-sz-meta">
        <tspan data-lang-en>24 px vector inside 64 px circle</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Vector 24 px trong hình tròn 64 px</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Row 2: Screenshots */}
      <text x="20" y="232" class="img-sz-h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>2. App screenshots (captured at 1440 px, shown in a 320 px slot)</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>2. Ảnh chụp giao diện (chụp ở 1440 px, nhét vào khung 320 px)</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Left card: Shrunk full app (Wrong) */}
      <rect x="20" y="248" width="415" height="164" rx="8" class="img-sz-card is-bad" />
      <text x="38" y="274" class="img-sz-label is-bad">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Full desktop screen shrunk to 25%</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Thu nhỏ toàn màn hình xuống 25%</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Tiny unreadable wireframe */}
      <g transform="translate(38, 288)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="150" height="106" rx="5" class="img-sz-stage" />
        {/* Tiny sidebar */}
        <rect x="4" y="4" width="24" height="98" rx="2" fill="var(--border)" opacity="0.5" />
        {/* Tiny topbar */}
        <rect x="32" y="4" width="114" height="10" rx="2" fill="var(--border)" opacity="0.7" />
        {/* Tiny 4 stat cards */}
        <rect x="32" y="18" width="26" height="16" rx="2" fill="var(--border)" opacity="0.55" />
        <rect x="61" y="18" width="26" height="16" rx="2" fill="var(--border)" opacity="0.55" />
        <rect x="90" y="18" width="26" height="16" rx="2" fill="var(--border)" opacity="0.55" />
        <rect x="119" y="18" width="27" height="16" rx="2" fill="var(--border)" opacity="0.55" />
        {/* Tiny unreadable table rows */}
        {[40, 48, 56, 64, 72, 80, 88, 96].map((ry) => (
          <g>
            <rect x="34" y={ry} width="22" height="3" rx="1" fill="var(--text-faint)" opacity="0.7" />
            <rect x="62" y={ry} width="34" height="3" rx="1" fill="var(--text-faint)" opacity="0.5" />
            <rect x="102" y={ry} width="18" height="3" rx="1" fill="var(--text-faint)" opacity="0.5" />
            <rect x="126" y={ry} width="16" height="3" rx="1" fill="var(--text-faint)" opacity="0.5" />
          </g>
        ))}
      </g>
      <text x="204" y="318" class="img-sz-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>16 px text shrinks to 4 px dust.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chữ 16 px teo lại thành 4 px mờ tịt.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="204" y="340" class="img-sz-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Readers see visual noise instead of</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Người xem chỉ thấy mảng xám rối mắt</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="204" y="358" class="img-sz-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>the feature you wanted to highlight.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>thay vì tính năng bạn muốn khoe.</tspan>
      </text>

      {/* Right card: Cropped / simplified UI (Correct) */}
      <rect x="465" y="248" width="415" height="164" rx="8" class="img-sz-card" />
      <text x="483" y="274" class="img-sz-label">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Partial crop or simplified preview</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Cắt cận cảnh hoặc lược giản chi tiết</tspan>
      </text>

      <defs>
        <clipPath id={`crop-${uid}`}>
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="150" height="106" rx="5" />
        </clipPath>
      </defs>
      <g transform="translate(483, 288)">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="150" height="106" rx="5" class="img-sz-stage" />
        <g clip-path={`url(#crop-${uid})`}>
          {/* Focused single card at legible scale */}
          <rect x="12" y="12" width="146" height="84" rx="6" fill="var(--bg)" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1.2" />
          <circle cx="30" cy="34" r="9" class="img-sz-tint" />
          <rect x="46" y="27" width="64" height="6" rx="3" fill="var(--text)" opacity="0.85" />
          <rect x="46" y="38" width="42" height="5" rx="2.5" fill="var(--text-muted)" opacity="0.6" />
          <line x1="22" y1="54" x2="146" y2="54" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1" />
          <rect x="22" y="66" width="52" height="18" rx="4" fill="var(--red)" />
          <rect x="82" y="66" width="46" height="18" rx="4" fill="var(--bg-alt)" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1" />
        </g>
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="150" height="106" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="var(--border)" stroke-width="1" />
      </g>
      <text x="649" y="318" class="img-sz-note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Capture at a smaller viewport or crop.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Chụp ở khung nhỏ hơn hoặc cắt cận.</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="649" y="340" class="img-sz-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>One legible widget beats a shrunken</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Một cụm UI rõ nét ăn đứt cả màn</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="649" y="358" class="img-sz-sub">
        <tspan data-lang-en>full-page dashboard every time.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>hình dashboard bị ép bé xíu.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Assets carry an intended viewing size. Frame small icons instead of stretching them, and crop or simplify screenshots instead of shrinking a full desktop view.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Mỗi tài nguyên hình ảnh đều có kích thước hiển thị chuẩn. Hãy đặt icon nhỏ vào khung nền thay vì phóng to, và cắt cận cảnh ảnh chụp thay vì thu nhỏ cả màn hình.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .img-sz { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .img-sz-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
  .img-sz svg { min-width: 640px; width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; font-family: inherit; }
  .img-sz-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .img-sz-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .img-sz-card.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .img-sz-stage { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .img-sz-tint { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); }
  .img-sz-label { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .img-sz-label.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .img-sz-note { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .img-sz-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .img-sz-meta { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .img-sz figcaption { margin-top: 0.75em; text-align: center; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
